{"id":"93be4ecb17896d81","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-degree-spectrum.md","title":"Degree Spectrum","display":"df-degree-spectrum — Degree Spectrum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-degree-spectrum","aliases":["68-df-degree-spectrum"],"display":"df-degree-spectrum — Degree Spectrum","depends_on":["[[68-df-turing-degree]]","[[68-df-structure]]","[[68-df-computable-structure]]","[[68-df-pairing-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"External relation-spectrum extension; not located in supplied §§1-20","verification_status":"external-source-unverified","source_proof_status":"definition-and-coding-reviewed","external_verification_status":"unverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-degree-spectrum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-degree-spectrum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-degree-spectrum — Degree Spectrum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"43fcc2f44ce938e0\" href=\"?note=43fcc2f44ce938e0\" title=\"68-df-turing-degree\">68-df-turing-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"27dbc26143606cc1\" href=\"?note=27dbc26143606cc1\" title=\"68-df-structure\">68-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41bf4c1fd4079b59\" href=\"?note=41bf4c1fd4079b59\" title=\"68-df-computable-structure\">68-df-computable-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3970a22e73ed3ca\" href=\"?note=a3970a22e73ed3ca\" title=\"68-df-pairing-function\">68-df-pairing-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"External relation-spectrum extension; not located in supplied §§1-20"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-source-unverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-and-coding-reviewed"},{"key":"external_verification_status","html":"unverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D_A^n\">\\(R\\subseteq D_A^n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是额外的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元关系，不要求属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sig}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sig}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\deg,\\mathrm{pair}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\deg,\\mathrm{pair}\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{code}_n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 递归定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Code}_n:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^n)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\operatorname{Code}_n:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^n)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>。编码条款中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_0,\\ldots,a_n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a_0,\\ldots,a_n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^n\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>。坐标像条款中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span> 允许是任意关系图；对同构函数图，该操作给出通常的逐坐标像。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}^{(n)}\">\\(\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}^{(n)}\\)</span> 的参数域均为满足上述条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(R,\\mathfrak A)\">\\((R,\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，值属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathcal D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_0(()):=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_{n+1}(a_0,\\ldots,a_n):=\\mathrm{pair}(a_0,\\operatorname{code}_n(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{code}_0(()):=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_{n+1}(a_0,\\ldots,a_n):=\\mathrm{pair}(a_0,\\operatorname{code}_n(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Code}_n(S):=\\{\\operatorname{code}_n(\\vec a):\\vec a\\in S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Code}_n(S):=\\{\\operatorname{code}_n(\\vec a):\\vec a\\in S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^{\\times n}[R]:=\\{\\vec b\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists\\vec a\\in R\\;\\forall i&lt;n\\;((\\vec a(i),\\vec b(i))\\in f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^{\\times n}[R]:=\\{\\vec b\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists\\vec a\\in R\\;\\forall i&lt;n\\;((\\vec a(i),\\vec b(i))\\in f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\{\\deg(\\operatorname{Code}_n(f^{\\times n}[R])):f\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\{\\deg(\\operatorname{Code}_n(f^{\\times n}[R])):f\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\{\\deg(\\operatorname{Code}_n(f^{\\times n}[R])):f\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\{\\deg(\\operatorname{Code}_n(f^{\\times n}[R])):f\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DegSpec}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DegSpec}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原 DegSpec 的“任意同构副本”取值范围，同时另给仅计算可计算副本的 DegSpec_c。任意副本谱不能与只考察可计算副本的 intrinsic computability 混用。R 不作为 σ 中已命名的基本关系，否则每个可计算副本中的基本关系本来就递归，研究性质退化。多元关系先逐坐标搬运，再用固定可计算单射编码为 N 的子集，才交给一元集合度算子 deg。编码像递归可判定；其可计算性与原 n 元关系的可计算性等价。所供全文未定位 degree spectrum 定义，本原子属于外部待核验扩展。</p>\n<p>本次把原来省略的元数写入函数标记；特别是空关系本身不能指定元数。坐标像使用关系成员式，不需要先对尚未验证为函数的候选图作函数求值。对同构图，新的写法与原坐标复合定义等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-turing-degree","status":"resolved","id":"43fcc2f44ce938e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"27dbc26143606cc1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-computable-structure","status":"resolved","id":"41bf4c1fd4079b59","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-computable-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-pairing-function","status":"resolved","id":"a3970a22e73ed3ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-pairing-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Structure}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"D_A=\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D_A^n","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sig}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{68},\\mathrm{CompStruct},\\deg,\\mathrm{pair}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}_n:\\mathbb N^n\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Code}_n:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^n)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"a_0,\\ldots,a_n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)},\\mathrm{DegSpec}^{(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"(R,\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}_0(()):=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_{n+1}(a_0,\\ldots,a_n):=\\mathrm{pair}(a_0,\\operatorname{code}_n(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Code}_n(S):=\\{\\operatorname{code}_n(\\vec a):\\vec a\\in S\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"f^{\\times n}[R]:=\\{\\vec b\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists\\vec a\\in R\\;\\forall i<n\\;((\\vec a(i),\\vec b(i))\\in f)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\{\\deg(\\operatorname{Code}_n(f^{\\times n}[R])):f\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm c}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\{\\deg(\\operatorname{Code}_n(f^{\\times n}[R])):f\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N)\\land\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;(\\mathrm{CompStruct}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Iso}_{68}(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DegSpec}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A):=\\mathrm{DegSpec}_{\\mathrm{all}}^{(n)}(R,\\mathfrak A).","display":true}],"bytes":3443,"backlinks":[{"id":"5e050274b891eb53","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"879b42e91247e55b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-spectrum|df-degree-spectrum — Degree Spectrum]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-spectrum]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-spectrum|df-degree-spectrum — Degree Spectrum]]"}],"outgoing":["43fcc2f44ce938e0","27dbc26143606cc1","41bf4c1fd4079b59","a3970a22e73ed3ca"]}